  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNFPA - SRHR in humanitarian crises - 2020-2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danish contribution to UNFPA in relation to the sexual and reproductive health and rights (SRHR) in humanitarian crises during a three year period from primo 2020 - ultimo 2022 by providing support for Scaling up UNFPA Surge Response in Humanitarian Contexts.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Scaling up UNFPA Surge Response in Humanitarian Contexts
Overall goal: Ensure a timely, effective and predictable response that ensures every woman and girl affected by an emergency or crisis has access to the protection and services needed to preserve her health and dignity. This overall program objective is to facilitate the ongoing strengthening and sustainability of UNFPA&#x2019;s global emergency surge roster through recruitment and preparation of experts to humanitarian country teams.

https://www.unfpa.org/publications</narrative>
  </description>
